-- =====================================================
-- BUSINESS SAFEGUARDS
-- =====================================================

-- Item prices exclude freight.
-- Item-price totals are not recognized revenue.

-- Active products and sellers are defined by
-- participation in the filtered Order Items fact.

-- Seller-order associations are distinct pairs,
-- not distinct marketplace orders.

-- Multi-order seller status is recalculated within
-- the selected purchase cohort.

-- Top 10 concentration removes Seller dimension
-- filters for the benchmark while preserving
-- applicable non-seller filters.

-- Seller Display ID is a presentation label only.
-- seller_id remains the canonical identifier.

